      "target": "../sections/sec-027-overview.md",
      "narrative": null,
      "content": "This specification defines the data model of the SPDX standard, describing every piece of information about systems with software\ncomponents. The data model is based on the Resource Description Framework (RDF) extensible knowledge representation data\nmodel, which provides a flexible and extensible way to represent and exchange information.\nThe data may be serialized in a variety of formats for storage and transmission.\n6.2",
