      "pageStart": 190,
      "pageEnd": 190,
      "target": "../sections/sec-336-purpose.md",
      "narrative": null,
      "content": "To ensure consistent results by different SPDX document creators when matching license information that will be included in\nSPDX data. SPDX document creators or tools may match on the license or exception text itself, the official license header, or the\nSPDX License List short identifier.\nC.2.2",
