      "target": "../sections/sec-337-guideline-official-license-headers.md",
      "narrative": null,
      "content": "The matching guidelines apply to license and exception text, as well as official license headers. Official license headers are defined\nby the SPDX License List as specific text specified within the license itself to be put in the header of files. (see explanation of\nSPDX License List fields2 for more info).\nThe following XML tag is used to implement this guideline: <standardLicenseHeader>\nC.3",
