      "content": "The Lite profile is designed to make it quick and easy to start a Software Bill of Materials in situations where a company may have\nlimited capacity for introducing new items into their processes. The Lite profile captures the minimum set of information required\nfor license compliance in the software supply chain. It contains information about the creation of the SBOM, package lists with\nlicensing and other related information, and their relationships.\nAll elements in Lite profile are essential for complying with licenses. It is easy to use a SPDX document with the Lite profile\nfor anyone who",
